00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.150
Happy birthday, my most shining star.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.720
Princess Elu, may you be healthy from now on.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:17.700
W-Who is it?

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:23.660
My name is Cubaton!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:28.590
Happy birthday, Princess Elu.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:32.580
