00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:49.470
Weehee

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:05.860
Give me back the princess!

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.240
Wait!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:11.060
Where is the idiot who is waiting for me to say wait?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:12.910
Yabaton-ton!

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.140
Be careful!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:42.010
I'll show you how to do it.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.840
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.800
Me he he he he he he!

00:06:20.668 --> 00:06:22.668
You

