00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.650
It's Sorashidoshi.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:31.790
Nice to meet you.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:39.980
I'm Shino!

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.110
